tfits, please visit\nhttps://twitter.com/AozoraTeien_i/status/1438799321479057408?s=20&t=lk0TUfpi-pYBkuf1nsm72Q\n\nOverall view of the characters\nhttps://twitter.com/Hiyono_Soradori/status/1451778951139893254?s=20&t=lk0TUfpi-pYBkuf1nsm72Q\n\nI also like Hyouga-san's cute girl drawings, so I would be very happy if you could draw her for me...!\nI'm looking forward to working with you.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hisasizutuki/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1460497, "client_id": 1386969, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5fd566d8/uploads/origins/9a451880-cb96-44e1-a026-03ca9b9170b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6a3511a28ea0e75d325bffe67f5844f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5fd566d8/uploads/origins/9a451880-cb96-44e1-a026-03ca9b9170b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6a3511a28ea0e75d325bffe67f5844f, https://si.imgix.net/5fd566d8/uploads/origins/9a451880-cb96-44e1-a026-03ca9b9170b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db383026ca72c926e8e6ccc8995453db 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5fd566d8/uploads/origins/9a451880-cb96-44e1-a026-03ca9b9170b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7918ee9c5536925140a61c32aeb6ac6d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5fd566d8/uploads/origins/9a451880-cb96-44e1-a026-03ca9b9170b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d63b119ec43230ed740dfaae43fa3f4b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5fd566d8/uploads/origins/9a451880-cb96-44e1-a026-03ca9b9170b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d63b119ec43230ed740dfaae43fa3f4b, https://si.imgix.net/5fd566d8/uploads/origins/9a451880-cb96-44e1-a026-03ca9b9170b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=77fabe92a8f4a595088fcf2c763d145c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5fd566d8/uploads/origins/9a451880-cb96-44e1-a026-03ca9b9170b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f65afe9bbde93e5d41b9cd07b8fd82e 3x"}, "body": "It's nice to meet you, Ice Rain Shigure-sama.\nMy name is Asahina Hinata, and I am a personal Vtuber.\n\nI've seen your skeb illustrations and they're so cute!\nI'd like to ask for your help!\n\nI'd like to use it for\nI'd like to use it as an icon, header, video, thumbnail image on SNS.\n\nThe costume\nPlease use one of my main costumes, kimono.\nI'll leave the pose, composition, and background up to you!\nI'd like it to look a little bit like the one in the previous request.\nIf you can draw me looking a little to the right, as you did in your last request\nIt's also great for Twitter icons and thumbnails\ud83d\ude4f.\n\nIf you can, I'd be happy if you could draw me with a different expression.\nI'm sorry to bother you, but I'm going to need a PSD with separate layers for the background and the person.\nIf you can give me the difference of the one without the background\nI would appreciate it if you could use it as a thumbnail.\n\nThere is a standing picture on Twitter, so if you like, please look there.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Asahi_7_Hinata/status/1465097304482877442\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Asahi_7_Hinata/status/1465097304482877442", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hisasizutuki/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1460497, "client_id": 834390, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96ade425/uploads/origins/988a28ac-1750-48e4-8f10-940706148de6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5ed3e8f0410239bf48e2abd54e5e8cc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/96ade425/uploads/origins/988a28ac-1750-48e4-8f10-940706148de6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5ed3e8f0410239bf48e2abd54e5e8cc, https://si.imgix.net/96ade425/uploads/origins/988a28ac-1750-48e4-8f10-940706148de6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b4900e3e4706097443d9ce57d112c7d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/96ade425/uploads/origins/988a28ac-1750-48e4-8f10-940706148de6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1b031764d28eb41dad466676066ae2a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96ade425/uploads/origins/988a28ac-1750-48e4-8f10-940706148de6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a03af4b5df313ab8ee86a87651a882ec", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/96ade425/uploads/origins/988a28ac-1750-48e4-8f10-940706148de6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a03af4b5df313ab8ee86a87651a882ec, https://si.imgix.net/96ade425/uploads/origins/988a28ac-1750-48e4-8f10-940706148de6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=072606751c6c60abd46d5f34e71ce10f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/96ade425/uploads/origins/988a28ac-1750-48e4-8f10-940706148de6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc0c43169983b65c88cc8ea6d2f2b694 3x"}, "body": "I see them all the time! Thank you for all your lovely drawings! I'll keep supporting you!\n\n\nI'd like to thank you.\nLupi-chan.\n(You don't need to address her.)\n\nI just want to see Lupi-chan!\nI'll ask you to draw Lupi-chan as you like (it's up to you).\n\n\nIn case that's too rough for you, I'll tell you my hallucination image.\n\n1:There are many lupi-chans (small or big. They seem to be messing around.)\n\n2: One Lupi-chan in front of the screen, very close to you (not exactly attached to you)\n\n3: Two shots of Lupi and Ren.\n\n\n(Of course, I also wanted to see the cute Lupi!)\nI hope you'll accept this request without any hesitation!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 41402, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u3044\u304b\u304a\ud83d\udc0d/skeb\u3068\u304b\u958b\u3051\u307e\u3057\u305f", "screen_name": "squidboy0125", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F8345dc39-bad7-4882-a8d6-1ebece4237b7.webp&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/4772e04f-8dae-4894-8b69-da8b65a42936.png?sensitive=true", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 1159814, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u30e6\u30c5\u30ad\u30fb\u30e6\u30c5\u30ea\u30cf\u262a\ufe0f\ud83c\udf3f\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u304a\u3048\u304b\u304d\u30e1\u30f3\u30d8\u30e9\u30d2\u30ad\u30cb\u30fc\u30c8", "screen_name": "YuzurihaChang", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1604917313576194049/2dO7pF5w.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1296473113081688064/1732971600/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "video"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 2620286, "creator": true, 